71	     * at {@code 1}, gains {@code 1} when an email is present, gains {@code 1} when the owner has no
72	     * namesakes ({@code namesakeCount} is {@code 0}), and is capped at {@code 3} (level {@code 4} is
73	     * reserved for tenure).
74	     */
